&lt;h2 id="-hardware-implementation">🚁 Hardware Implementation
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="sensor-calibration">Sensor Calibration
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Camera-IMU Spatiotemporal Calibration using Kalibr:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>We performed rigorous calibration to ensure accurate sensor fusion:&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Data Collection&lt;/strong>: Captured 10 minutes of calibration board sequences&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Intrinsic Calibration&lt;/strong>: Camera parameters with &amp;lt; 0.1 pixel reprojection error&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Extrinsic Calibration&lt;/strong>: Camera-IMU transformation matrix&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Temporal Calibration&lt;/strong>: Time offset estimation (&amp;lt; 5ms accuracy)&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://Ricardo-Guo.github.io/kalibr_residuals.jpg"
loading="lazy"
alt="Kalibr Residual Plot"
>
&lt;em>Figure: Calibration residual plots showing sub-pixel accuracy&lt;/em>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Calibration Results:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">8
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c"># Camera-IMU Extrinsics (T_target_cam)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">rotation&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">0.9999&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>-&lt;span class="m">0.0012&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">0.0123&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">0.0015&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">0.9998&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>-&lt;span class="m">0.0201&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>-&lt;span class="m">0.0121&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">0.0203&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">0.9997&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">translation&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">0.0234&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>-&lt;span class="m">0.0012&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">0.0456&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="c"># meters&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="c"># Time offset: 2.3 ms&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
