&lt;h3 id="challenges--solutions">Challenges &amp;amp; Solutions
&lt;/h3>&lt;h4 id="challenge-1-ros2-cross-device-communication-latency">Challenge 1: ROS2 Cross-Device Communication Latency
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Problem&lt;/strong>: Network latency caused pose updates to arrive 50-100ms late.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Solution&lt;/strong>:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Implemented &lt;strong>ZeroMQ-based&lt;/strong> high-frequency channel for pose data&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Used &lt;strong>ROS2 QoS policies&lt;/strong> for time-critical messages&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Achieved &lt;strong>&amp;lt; 10ms&lt;/strong> end-to-end latency&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">8
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// Custom ZeroMQ publisher for low-latency pose streaming
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">auto&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">publisher&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">zmq&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">socket_t&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">context&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">zmq&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">socket_style&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">pub&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">publisher&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">bind&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;tcp://*:5555&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">while&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">rclcpp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">ok&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">())&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">PoseMessage&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">msg&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">get_latest_pose&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">();&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">publisher&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">send&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">zmq&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">buffer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">msg&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">serialize&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()),&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">zmq&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">send_flags&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">none&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h4 id="challenge-2-imu-noise-under-vibration">Challenge 2: IMU Noise Under Vibration
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Problem&lt;/strong>: Motor vibrations caused IMU spikes, degrading VIO accuracy.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Solution&lt;/strong>:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Hardware&lt;/strong>: Added vibration dampening mounts&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Software&lt;/strong>: Adaptive threshold-based outlier rejection&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Filter&lt;/strong>: Complementary filter with vibration detection&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// Adaptive IMU noise model
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">double&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">get_adaptive_noise&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">double&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">vibration_level&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">base_noise_&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mf">1.0&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">vibration_gain_&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">vibration_level&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// Outlier rejection
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">accel_magnitude&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">threshold&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">reject_measurement&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">();&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">flag_vibration_detected&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">();&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h4 id="challenge-3-computational-optimization">Challenge 3: Computational Optimization
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Problem&lt;/strong>: OpenVINS processing took 80ms per frame, limiting to 12Hz.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Solution&lt;/strong>:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>GPU Acceleration&lt;/strong>: Ported feature tracking to CUDA&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Multi-threading&lt;/strong>: Parallel MSCKF updates for multiple UAVs&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Code Optimization&lt;/strong>: SIMD instructions for matrix operations&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Performance Improvement:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
